OL,3,GNEWSAHealth board sorry after death of
OL,4,Aman given wrong types of food
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS Grampian has apologised after being
OL,7,Ffined over the death of a patient who
OL,8,Fwas given the wrong types of food.
OL,10,FPatrick Brogan, 89, was being treated
OL,11,Fat AberB-deen Royal InfirmB-ary.
OL,13,FHe had special dietary requirements,
OL,14,Fbut initially choked on food and was
OL,15,Flater given another inappropriate meal.
OL,16,FHe developed the lung infection
OL,17,Faspiration pneumonia, and died in
OL,18,FJanuary 2024.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
