OL,3,GNEWSAHealth board sorry after death of
OL,4,Aman given wrong types of food
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS Grampian admitted health and safety
OL,7,Ffailings at Aberdeen Sheriff Court. The
OL,8,Fboard was fined #70,000 with an added
OL,9,Fvictim surcharge of #5,250, which helps
OL,10,Fvictim support organisations.
